// The first half of a rep, as far as the window goes: type an answer and pick a confidence. Committing both is the engine's (session_answer_item); nothing after a commit can change what was committed (P1: the learner lifts first).

// Replace the answer being typed, while the rep is still waiting for its attempt; once the attempt is committed the answer is fixed.
gym_type(Session gym_state, string gym_text) {
  int[] gym_cells = gym_state.cells;
  string[] gym_texts = gym_state.texts;
  if(gym_cells[(import gym_cell_stage)] == (import gym_stage_waiting)) {
    gym_texts[(import gym_text_answer)] = gym_text;
  }
} return void;
